{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:81f954f7d04d880c97a569c36614bec95c3186035de828d611dc8b7770962b4b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_a:2_4_032_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:123f15ec73f5f7d832a946f596dbcfde6b595ad4521127fc30f0c9c9b4c9b3fa",
      "text": "制作人，辛苦了。\n我是冈村直央。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_a:2_4_032_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:440897b7c39ebc2a850722c85667ef3323228b0ffa4253d060dad5d92e3e61ee",
      "text": "前阵子拍摄的游乐设施宣传活动，\n从今天开始正式启动了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_a:2_4_032_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d28ad1466c518005436b1a753ae6d8b922852752a0f979e504f2329e09b4ed0",
      "text": "妈妈在车站看到贴着的海报，\n帮我拍了照片。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_a:2_4_032_01_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8df078f57e7a01e62f11bf2a9f40807f525b37459aa327c40e9f18eb70abf64",
      "text": "那太令人高兴了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_a:2_4_032_01_09_a:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6c548487a61a5f7ffff254e12d117010e18dc009080c7ad7179c58ac49da85b",
      "text": "重新看了一下，\n感觉怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_a:2_4_032_01_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf581b0ff986058d96030d391c88de2c405c69aaf9c28917f2555bcd77e5cf06",
      "text": "是的！第一次看到实际张贴出来的样子，\n心里扑通扑通直跳。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_a:2_4_032_01_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ad8eb784bfccfeb5c8b5dd878a8e78228cff623708f44678c4d8c945651289b",
      "text": "那个……穿着帅气服装的我自己被印得很大，\n感觉有一点点害羞。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_a:2_4_032_01_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d5cf57be537b98fb0511450448d406b9e86956cb846c873ee1fb2843f20965",
      "text": "不过，那是一份很开心的工作，\n希望这次的宣传活动能够顺利成功。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_a:2_4_032_01_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:080b8f05a59e2b54571d04bc18140b85562cfab97a8defa6499f356e16218b4c",
      "text": "而且还帮我拍了好多照片。说起来，\n那种海报好像有好多不同的款式呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_a:2_4_032_01_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e72d4fcdb2b8708ad3c57f373c7716f0a36c362658b9570958657ab524770f3b",
      "text": "一想到大家的海报会在哪里呢，\n就觉得像在寻宝一样，挺好玩的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_a:2_4_032_01_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:045ca520431095a830fb280e3a0a9005f3c1b39662f84a97e808a1231d669259",
      "text": "花音君他们也说了，要是找到我们的海报，\n就会把照片发过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_a:2_4_032_01_09_a:cmd-000032:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4167b1906143da9798571366e73b4bc5d9e54aaa326336183b05c2fa2b7dafc0",
      "text": "我也去找找看",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_a:2_4_032_01_09_a:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:745e7d6d5dc976bf597c4b4428259519059455c171149ef1df7892416b5a891f",
      "text": "呵呵。那我也去找找看\n一起拍摄的各位的海报吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:032nao_401_2_4_032_01_09_a:2_4_032_01_09_a:cmd-000037:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00fb7f8c81feaedd179bc97a9d17fb321b21f7d1f255322da983dba115029eee",
      "text": "那么，我再跟您联络。制作人，\n谢谢您接听我的电话。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
